        "@value": "Di Iorio, A., Peroni, S., Poggi, F., Vitali, F. (2012). Aﬁrst approach to the automatic recognition ofstructural patterns in XML documents. In Proceedingsof the 2012 ACM symposium on Document Engineering(DocEng 2012): 85-94. DOI: 10.1145/2361354.2361374"
      }
    ],
